usage: test_editor_mixed_causal_current_regressions.py [-h]
                                                       [--group {default-factory,default-controller,focused-causal43,causal26,publication56} |
                                                       --all] [--list-groups]
                                                       [--show-selection]

Current-source HOST regressions in a contained temporary source tree. No
archive, Git, repository write, native compiler or target operation. The exact
literal font header is generated only in an owned TemporaryDirectory. Full
command streams/receipts remain in a separate owned attempt directory. No
driver imports tests.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --group {default-factory,default-controller,focused-causal43,causal26,publication56}
  --all                 run all five genuine groups
  --list-groups         list group bounds; no source access or tests
  --show-selection      print selected labels; no source access or tests
